      },
      "has_children": false,
      "in_trash": false,
      "type": "quote",
      "quote": {
        "rich_text": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": {
              "content": "Another way to save time is not verbally going over what we accomplished yesterday. We could all take a minute to read each other's written updates and only verbally say what we're going to do today.",
              "link": null
            },
            "annotations": {
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false,
              "strikethrough": false,
              "underline": false,
              "code": false,
              "color": "default"
            },
            "plain_text": "Another way to save time is not verbally going over what we accomplished yesterday. We could all take a minute to read each other's written updates and only verbally say what we're going to do today.",
            "href": null
          }
        ],
        "color": "default"
      }
    },
    {
      "object": "block",
      "id": "b08e5e6a-219c-4abc-bff0-9f1a4b113a5b",
      "parent": {
        "type": "page_id",
        "page_id": "885e5a3e-c419-444b-beb1-6255777c2751"
      },
      "created_time": "2022-06-01T16:32:00.000Z",
      "last_edited_time": "2022-06-01T16:32:00.000Z",
      "created_by": {
        "object": "user",
        "id": "00c350d3-9f7b-4bc1-b27d-24e15ac5139f"
      },
      "last_edited_by": {
        "object": "user",
        "id": "00c350d3-9f7b-4bc1-b27d-24e15ac5139f"
      },
      "has_children": false,
      "in_trash": false,
      "type": "paragraph",
      "paragraph": {
        "rich_text": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": {
              "content": "I can definitely see how reading written updates would be time-saving, but I actually feel like -- it's really important to spend our shared attention time during a meeting on \"celebrating the things people have already done\", as opposed to just \"talking about things people might do\".",
              "link": null
            },
            "annotations": {
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false,
              "strikethrough": false,
              "underline": false,
              "code": false,
              "color": "default"
            },
            "plain_text": "I can definitely see how reading written updates would be time-saving, but I actually feel like -- it's really important to spend our shared attention time during a meeting on \"celebrating the things people have already done\", as opposed to just \"talking about things people might do\".",
            "href": null
          }
        ],
        "icon": null,
        "color": "default"
      }
    },
    {
      "object": "block",
      "id": "1ac2e33b-a2f7-405f-b1be-336c757a61d5",
      "parent": {
        "type": "page_id",
        "page_id": "885e5a3e-c419-444b-beb1-6255777c2751"
      },
      "created_time": "2022-06-01T16:32:00.000Z",
      "last_edited_time": "2022-06-01T16:32:00.000Z",
      "created_by": {
        "object": "user",
        "id": "00c350d3-9f7b-4bc1-b27d-24e15ac5139f"
      },
